DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/samizdat-may-2027\n\nTake a s
 eat at a manual typewriter and create a limited edition\, uncensored\, uno
 fficial publication to circulate from hand to hand.  Just like Eastern Eur
 opean dissidents used to do in the 1960's and 70's.  (Here's an old-school
 \, digitized example from Stanford Libraries' collections.)  Typewriters\,
  carbon paper\, onionskin paper all provided.  Hohbach Hall lobby (Green L
 ibrary\, 1st floor\, near the reference desk)\, 3-5PM.
